          "TitleHtml": "<div class=\"chunk-title\">Sec. 1.01.010. - Designation and citation.</div>",
          "ShouldShowMiniToc": false,
          "Id": "PT2READCO_TIT1GEPR_CH1.01COINCO_S1.01.010DECI",
          "Title": "Sec. 1.01.010. - Designation and citation.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"b0\">\n               The ordinances embraced in this and the following chapters and sections shall constitute\n               and be designated the \"Reno Municipal Code\" and may be so cited.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Code 1966, § 1.01.010)\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"refcharter0\" block_type=\"hang\"><b>Charter reference— </b>\n               Codification authority, <a href=\"\" data-chunk-id=\"PT1RECH_ARTIILEDE_S2.120COORPUCO\" class=\"section-link\" data-product-id=\"14160\">§ 2.120</a>.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"refstatelaw0\" block_type=\"hang\"><b>State Law reference— </b>\n               Codification authority, NRS 268.014.\n               </p></div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
      ],
